// [🔬coda🖱️desktop💻renderer🔖renderer🔖pages🔖configpage🛠️propertyview](repo://p/r/coda/b/u/desktop/f/renderer.tsx/s/Renderer/s/Pages/s/ConfigPage/d/i/PropertyView)
