// [🔬coda🖱️desktop💻renderer🔖renderer🔖welcome🛠️welcomepage](repo://p/r/coda/b/u/desktop/f/renderer.tsx/s/Renderer/s/Welcome/d/i/WelcomePage)
 *MUST show create-new-project form and open-existing-project button.
